- Installation progress
    - Poll event
            - If BACKUP_NEEDED - return page for DIFF 
            - Otherwise - return FINISHED page

- DIFF page:
    - /diff/{old_filename}/{new_filename}
        - If SAME_FORMAT -- show 1 windows diff 
            - On /resolve/new - delete old file and paste new
            - On /resolve/old - delete new file and paste old
            - On /resolve/backup - rename old file to %filenmae.backup.%ext, paste new file
        - Otherwise - show 2 window diff
            - On /resolve/new - delete old file and paste new
            - On /resolve/old - delete new file and paste old
            - On /resolve/backup - rename old file to %filenmae.backup.%ext, paste new file



